        <div class="osa-pillar-card"><div class="osa-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-6h2v6zm0-8h-2V7h2v2z"/></svg></div><h3>Body Scan and Massage Programs</h3><p>Body scan technology helps the chair estimate shoulder position and body shape before starting a session. Massage programs then combine roller movement, air massage, recline position, and intensity settings.</p></div>
        <div class="osa-pillar-card"><div class="osa-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M11 21h-1l1-7H7.5c-.58 0-.57-.32-.38-.66l5-10.67h1l-1 7h3.5c.49 0 .56.33.47.51L11 21z"/></svg></div><h3>Air Massage and Calf Kneading</h3><p>Air massage compression and calf kneading features can add lower-body coverage beyond the back rollers. Buyers who stand, walk, or commute frequently should compare these features during a showroom trial.</p></div>
