      <div class="osa-pillar-grid">
        <div class="osa-pillar-card"><div class="osa-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6H2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14v-2H4V6zm16-4H8c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h12c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2z"/></svg></div><h3>Widest Model Range in Segment</h3><p>Osaki offers more distinct massage chair configurations than virtually any other premium U.S.-market brand. More options to match varied body types, use cases, and budgets without jumping between brands.</p></div>
        <div class="osa-pillar-card"><div class="osa-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M11 21h-1l1-7H7.5c-.58 0-.57-.32-.38-.66l5-10.67h1l-1 7h3.5c.49 0 .56.33.47.51L11 21z"/></svg></div><h3>3D and 4D Massage Rollers</h3><p>At nearly every price point, Osaki delivers competitive feature density with 3D and 4D massage rollers. Buyers comparing mid-range options often find Osaki chairs offer more advanced massage technology at prices where some competing models may include fewer features.</p></div>
        <div class="osa-pillar-card"><div class="osa-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.4 10.5l4.77-8.26C13.47 2.09 12.75 2 12 2c-2.4 0-4.6.85-6.32 2.25L9.4 10.5zm12.28 2.24H12.37l-2.68 4.63 4.77 8.26c2.6-.86 4.75-2.75 6.01-5.12L21.68 12.74zm-12.3.01L6.34 10H2.04C2.01 10.33 2 10.66 2 11c0 3.51 1.81 6.59 4.54 8.38L9.38 12.75zM20.45 7.63A9.97 9.97 0 0015.2 4.1l-3.04 5.25h6.81a9.99 9.99 0 001.48-1.72z"/></svg></div><h3>Advanced Technology Across Tiers</h3><p>4D rollers, zero gravity, AI body scanning, dual-engine Duo systems, SL-track, and full-body air compression are not reserved for flagship models only.</p></div>
        <div class="osa-pillar-card"><div class="osa-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-6h2v6zm0-8h-2V7h2v2z"/></svg></div><h3>Air Massage, Calf Kneading and Heat Comfort Features</h3><p>Osaki models offer air massage compression, calf kneading, and heat therapy-style comfort features across multiple price tiers. These lower-body and comfort-focused features complement the roller massage and can significantly change how a session feels.</p></div>
        <div class="osa-pillar-card"><div class="osa-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg></div><h3>SL-Track and Body Scan Options</h3><p>Most Osaki models use SL-track or extended track designs paired with body scan technology. This combination helps position massage rollers accurately and deliver a more complete massage experience from neck to lower back.</p></div>
        <div class="osa-pillar-card"><div class="osa-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 11c1.66 0 2.99-1.34 2.99-3S17.66 5 16 5c-1.66 0-3 1.34-3 3s1.34 3 3 3zm-8 0c1.66 0 2.99-1.34 2.99-3S9.66 5 8 5C6.34 5 5 6.34 5 8s1.34 3 3 3zm0 2c-2.33 0-7 1.17-7 3.5V19h14v-2.5c0-2.33-4.67-3.5-7-3.5zm8 0c-.29 0-.62.02-.97.05 1.16.84 1.97 1.97 1.97 3.45V19h6v-2.5c0-2.33-4.67-3.5-7-3.5z"/></svg></div><h3>Showroom-Based Model Matching</h3><p>From first-time premium buyers to experienced users trading up, Osaki has a relevant model at each stage of the buying journey. Our showroom specialists help you match the right model to your body, budget, and daily use preferences.</p></div>
