  {%- comment -%} ══════════ FAQ ══════════ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="osa-section osa-section-alt" id="osa-faq">
    <div class="osa-container-narrow">
      <div class="osa-section-header center">
        <span class="osa-section-label">Frequently Asked</span>
        <h2>Osaki Massage Chair <span class="osa-underline">FAQ</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--osa-border)">
        <div class="osa-faq-item"><div class="osa-faq-q" onclick="osaFaq(this)"><h3>Are Osaki massage chairs worth it?</h3><svg class="osa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="osa-faq-a"><p>Yes — for buyers who match the right model to their needs. Osaki consistently delivers strong feature density and genuine 4D massage technology at competitive price points. The key is choosing the right model, which is why in-person guidance matters.</p></div></div>
        <div class="osa-faq-item"><div class="osa-faq-q" onclick="osaFaq(this)"><h3>What is the best Osaki massage chair?</h3><svg class="osa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="osa-faq-a"><p>The "best" Osaki chair depends entirely on your body type, use case, intensity preference, and budget. No-compromise flagship: the AI Grand Duo or Pinnacle 5D DuoFlex AI. Best dual-engine value: the DuoMax or DuoMax SE. Best for taller users: Atlas XL. Best 4D entry: Zion 4D.</p></div></div>
        <div class="osa-faq-item"><div class="osa-faq-q" onclick="osaFaq(this)"><h3>Which Osaki chair has the strongest massage?</h3><svg class="osa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="osa-faq-a"><p>Generally, the dual-engine Duo models (Grand Duo, DuoMax, AI Apex Duo) deliver the most assertive total-body massage due to simultaneous dual-mechanism operation. Intensity is always best assessed in person, as body-to-seat fit significantly affects how pressure is experienced.</p></div></div>
        <div class="osa-faq-item"><div class="osa-faq-q" onclick="osaFaq(this)"><h3>Are Osaki chairs good for tall people?</h3><svg class="osa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="osa-faq-a"><p>The Osaki Atlas XL is specifically designed for users up to 6'5" with extended dimensions across shoulder, seat, and leg rest sections. For buyers over 6'0", fit verification in person is critical.</p></div></div>
        <div class="osa-faq-item"><div class="osa-faq-q" onclick="osaFaq(this)"><h3>Can I try Osaki massage chairs in person?</h3><svg class="osa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="osa-faq-a"><p>Yes. House of Massage Chairs carries multiple Osaki models at our San Jose showroom at Westfield Oakridge Mall and at our Pleasanton location. We strongly recommend an in-person visit before any Osaki purchase. <a href="{{ shop.url }}/pages/our-store">Book your visit here.</a></p></div></div>
        <div class="osa-faq-item"><div class="osa-faq-q" onclick="osaFaq(this)"><h3>How much does a good Osaki massage chair cost?</h3><svg class="osa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="osa-faq-a"><p>Osaki's price range spans from $2,999 (Oasis) to $16,999 (Pinnacle 5D). Most buyers find the best feature-for-dollar proposition in the $7,000–$11,000 range.</p></div></div>
        <div class="osa-faq-item"><div class="osa-faq-q" onclick="osaFaq(this)"><h3>Do Osaki chairs come with a warranty?</h3><svg class="osa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="osa-faq-a"><p>Yes. Osaki massage chairs include manufacturer-backed warranties covering parts, labor, and structural frame. Coverage terms vary by model tier. HOMC assists with all warranty coordination.</p></div></div>
        <div class="osa-faq-item"><div class="osa-faq-q" onclick="osaFaq(this)"><h3>Is Osaki a good brand compared with competitors?</h3><svg class="osa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="osa-faq-a"><p>Osaki is a credible, well-established premium brand that consistently delivers strong feature density at competitive prices. The best way to assess this for your specific needs is a side-by-side comparison at our showroom.</p></div></div>
        <div class="osa-faq-item"><div class="osa-faq-q" onclick="osaFaq(this)"><h3>What is the difference between an Osaki 3D massage chair and a 4D massage chair?</h3><svg class="osa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="osa-faq-a"><p>An Osaki 3D massage chair typically allows roller depth adjustment, while an Osaki 4D massage chair may offer more variation in roller rhythm, speed, and intensity depending on the model.</p></div></div>
        <div class="osa-faq-item"><div class="osa-faq-q" onclick="osaFaq(this)"><h3>Do Osaki massage chairs use SL-track technology?</h3><svg class="osa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="osa-faq-a"><p>Many Osaki massage chairs use SL-track or extended track designs, but the exact track system varies by model. Always compare the track type, roller coverage, and body fit before choosing.</p></div></div>
        <div class="osa-faq-item"><div class="osa-faq-q" onclick="osaFaq(this)"><h3>What does body scan technology do in an Osaki massage chair?</h3><svg class="osa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="osa-faq-a"><p>Body scan technology helps the chair estimate shoulder position and body shape before starting a massage program. It can improve alignment, but the actual fit should still be tested in person.</p></div></div>
        <div class="osa-faq-item"><div class="osa-faq-q" onclick="osaFaq(this)"><h3>Do Osaki massage chairs include air massage and calf kneading?</h3><svg class="osa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="osa-faq-a"><p>Many Osaki models include air massage compression and calf kneading features, but coverage and intensity vary by model. Buyers who care about foot and leg comfort should compare these features during a showroom trial.</p></div></div>
        <div class="osa-faq-item"><div class="osa-faq-q" onclick="osaFaq(this)"><h3>Do Osaki chairs have heat therapy?</h3><svg class="osa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="osa-faq-a"><p>Some Osaki chairs include heat therapy-style comfort features. These features are designed to add warmth and comfort during a massage session, not to replace medical care or professional treatment.</p></div></div>
        <div class="osa-faq-item"><div class="osa-faq-q" onclick="osaFaq(this)"><h3>Do Osaki massage chairs have a touchscreen controller?</h3><svg class="osa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="osa-faq-a"><p>Some Osaki models include a touchscreen controller or advanced control interface. During a showroom visit, test how easy it is to adjust massage programs, recline position, roller intensity, and air massage settings.</p></div></div>
        <div class="osa-faq-item"><div class="osa-faq-q" onclick="osaFaq(this)"><h3>Are Osaki massage chairs good for muscle relaxation?</h3><svg class="osa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="osa-faq-a"><p>Osaki massage chairs may support a relaxing massage experience through roller movement, air massage compression, recline positioning, heat comfort features, and customizable massage programs. They should not be treated as medical devices or substitutes for professional care or massage therapy.</p></div></div>
        <div class="osa-faq-item"><div class="osa-faq-q" onclick="osaFaq(this)"><h3>Does Osaki have space-saving technology?</h3><svg class="osa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="osa-faq-a"><p>Some Osaki models may include space-saving recline designs or lower wall-clearance requirements. Check the specific model's dimensions, reclined length, and wall clearance before purchase.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

